  A clean UBL 2.1 invoice in the shape an ERP exports for Peppol BIS Billing
  3.0 / XRechnung UBL. It exercises the parts real invoices get wrong: two VAT
  rates, a document-level discount coded to one of them, and a part payment.

  Line 1   2 x 100.00           = 200.00   S 19%
  Line 2   3 x  50.00           = 150.00   S  7%
  Line total                      350.00
  Discount (coded to S 19%)       -10.00
  Tax-exclusive                   340.00
  VAT   S 19% on 190.00            36.10
  VAT   S  7% on 150.00            10.50
  Tax-inclusive                   386.60
  Prepaid                         -86.60
  Due                             300.00
-->
